  "title": "Orange Chicken",
  "description": "This orange chicken recipe is for the sticky, sweet, and delicious Chinese-style dish. It's easier to make than you think for a tasty takeout dinner at home.",
  "authors": [
    "HARRY WETZEL"
  ],
